- **PNP nomination is THE pathway** — standalone Express Entry is closed at CRS ~330-380 vs cutoff ~462-476. Ontario's June 2026 stream overhaul adds live uncertainty.
- **CE overstatement at 50% vs 85%: ~38% (1.62x $/DCY)** because returners capture only ~8-9% of stayer income value.
- **Correlated tail risk: ~10% P(severe cohort-wide event)** where stay rate drops to ~15%.
- **7 due-diligence recommendations**, led by: ask Passage for actual outcome data on prior cohorts, model at 50% central, and monitor Ontario's new Workforce Priority stream rules.
